"# Milestone 00 — Research Archaeology\n\n**Time:** ~3 hours | **Artifact:** data-audit.md\n\nBefore touching a single response, understand what you have.\n\n## Do\n1. Document who was surveyed and how they were recruited\n2. Flag questions with wording problems\n3. Map non-response concentration\n4. State what the data can and cannot legitimately claim\n\n## Artifact spec\nartifact.md with four sections above. Every limitation phrased as an implication, not a description.\n\n## Reflection\nWhere did you want the data to support more than it can?"
